#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:2
msgid "Azure Active Directory SSO (SAML)"
msgstr "Azure Active Directory SSO (SAML)"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:4
msgid ""
"Azure Active Directory Single Sign-on can be added as a Identity Source "
"in |morpheus| using the SAML Identity Source Type. The Azure AD SSO "
"configuration is slightly different than other SAML providers, and this "
"guide will assist in adding a Azure AD SSO Identity Source."
msgstr "O Single Sign-on do Azure Active Directory pode ser adicionado como uma Identity Source no |morpheus| usando o Tipo de Identity Source SAML. A configuração do Azure AD SSO é ligeiramente diferente de outros provedores SAML, e este guia ajudará a adicionar uma Identity Source Azure AD SSO."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:8
msgid "Create Azure Enterprise Application"
msgstr "Criar Azure Enterprise Application"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:10
msgid "Login to the `Azure Portal <https://portal.azure.com>`_"
msgstr "Faça login no `Azure Portal <https://portal.azure.com>`_"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:11
msgid "Navigate to: ``Azure Active Directory > Enterprise Applications``"
msgstr "Navegue até: ``Azure Active Directory > Enterprise Applications``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:12
msgid "Click the ``+ New application`` button at the top"
msgstr "Clique no botão ``+ New application`` na parte superior"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:13
msgid "Click the ``+ Create your own application`` button at the top"
msgstr "Clique no botão ``+ Create your own application`` na parte superior"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:14
msgid ""
"Ensure ``Integrate any other application you don't find in the gallery "
"(Non-gallery)`` is selected and enter a name for the app.  Common "
"examples are:  ``MorpheusSSO``"
msgstr "Certifique-se de que ``Integrate any other application you don't find in the gallery (Non-gallery)`` esteja selecionado e informe um nome para o app. Exemplos comuns são: ``MorpheusSSO``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:15
msgid "Click the ``Create`` button at the bottom and wait for it to complete"
msgstr "Clique no botão ``Create`` na parte inferior e aguarde a conclusão"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:16
msgid ""
"Once created, you'll be in the ``Overview`` of the application created.  "
"Navigate to the ``Single sign-on`` section from the left pane"
msgstr "Após a criação, você estará em ``Overview`` da aplicação criada. Navegue até a seção ``Single sign-on`` no painel esquerdo"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:17
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:62
msgid "Choose ``SAML`` as the Single sign-on method"
msgstr "Escolha ``SAML`` como o método de Single sign-on"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:18
msgid ""
"Copy both the ``Login URL`` and ``Logout URL`` in Step 4, we'll need "
"these in some of the next steps"
msgstr "Copie tanto a ``Login URL`` quanto a ``Logout URL`` no Passo 4; precisaremos delas em alguns dos próximos passos"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:19
msgid ""
"Before we can continue configuring the application, the configuration "
"needs to be generated in |morpheus| for more data"
msgstr "Antes de continuar a configurar a aplicação, a configuração precisa ser gerada no |morpheus| para obter mais dados"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:22
msgid "Create an Azure AD SAML Integration in |morpheus|"
msgstr "Criar uma Integração Azure AD SAML no |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:24
msgid ""
"Azure requires inputting the ``Identifier (Entity ID)`` and ``Reply URL "
"(Assertion Consumer Service URL)`` in the Azure SSO configuration before "
"it provides the Endpoints and Certificate necessary to add the "
"Integration into |morpheus|. In order to get the ``Identifier (Entity "
"ID)`` and ``Reply URL (Assertion Consumer Service URL)`` to input into "
"Azure SSO configuration, we need to create a ``Azure AD SAML SSO`` "
"integration in |morpheus| first."
msgstr "O Azure exige informar o ``Identifier (Entity ID)`` e a ``Reply URL (Assertion Consumer Service URL)`` na configuração Azure SSO antes de fornecer os Endpoints e o Certificate necessários para adicionar a Integração no |morpheus|. Para obter o ``Identifier (Entity ID)`` e a ``Reply URL (Assertion Consumer Service URL)`` a informar na configuração Azure SSO, precisamos criar primeiro uma integração ``Azure AD SAML SSO`` no |morpheus|."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:28
msgid "To add the integration:"
msgstr "Para adicionar a integração:"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:30
msgid "Login to |morpheus|"
msgstr "Faça login no |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:31
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:99
msgid "Navigate to |AdmTen|"
msgstr "Navegue até |AdmTen|"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:32
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:100
msgid "Click a tenant hyperlink"
msgstr "Clique em um hyperlink de tenant"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:33
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`IDENTITY SOURCES` button in the Tenant detail page"
msgstr "Clique no botão :guilabel:`IDENTITY SOURCES` na página de detalhe do Tenant"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:34
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`+ ADD IDENTITY SOURCE` button"
msgstr "Clique no botão :guilabel:`+ ADD IDENTITY SOURCE`"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:35
msgid "Select ``Azure AD SAML SSO`` from the ``TYPE`` dropdown"
msgstr "Selecione ``Azure AD SAML SSO`` no dropdown ``TYPE``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:36
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Adicionar"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:38
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nome"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:40
msgid "(Optional) Description"
msgstr "(Opcional) Descrição"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:42
msgid ""
"Paste the ``Login URL`` copied from Azure into the ``LOGIN REDIRECT URL``"
" field"
msgstr "Cole a ``Login URL`` copiada do Azure no campo ``LOGIN REDIRECT URL``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:44
msgid ""
"Paste the ``Logout URL`` copied from Azure into the ``SAML LOGOUT "
"REDIRECT URL`` field"
msgstr "Cole a ``Logout URL`` copiada do Azure no campo ``SAML LOGOUT REDIRECT URL``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:46
msgid ""
"This is the minimum information needed for now, which will let us "
"generate the details needed from |morpheus|.  We'll return to this "
"configuration page later to enter more information."
msgstr "Estas são as informações mínimas necessárias por enquanto, o que nos permitirá gerar os detalhes necessários a partir do |morpheus|. Retornaremos a esta página de configuração mais tarde para informar mais informações."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:47
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES` button"
msgstr "Clique no botão :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:49
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:123
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:134
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Importante"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:49
msgid ""
"Setting SAML REQUEST to \"No Signature\" and SAML RESPONSE to \"Do Not "
"Validate Assertion Signature\" is allowed but not recommended for "
"security reasons."
msgstr "Definir SAML REQUEST como \"No Signature\" e SAML RESPONSE como \"Do Not Validate Assertion Signature\" é permitido, mas não recomendado por motivos de segurança."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:51
msgid ""
"Upon saving, the `Entity ID` (``Identifier (Entity ID)``) and `SP ACS "
"URL` (``Reply URL (Assertion Consumer Service URL)``) will be provide in "
"the Identity Source list view. Copy these for use in Azure SSO "
"configuration."
msgstr "Ao salvar, o `Entity ID` (``Identifier (Entity ID)``) e a `SP ACS URL` (``Reply URL (Assertion Consumer Service URL)``) serão fornecidos na visualização de lista da Identity Source. Copie-os para uso na configuração Azure SSO."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:53
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"/images/integration_guides/identity_sources/azure_ad_saml/saml_setup.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:57
msgid "Configure Azure Enterprise Application"
msgstr "Configurar Azure Enterprise Application"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:59
msgid ""
"This guide assumes an Azure AD Enterprise Application has already been "
"created. Please refer to documentation above, if this has not already "
"been configured."
msgstr "Este guia pressupõe que uma Azure AD Enterprise Application já tenha sido criada. Consulte a documentação acima se isso ainda não tiver sido configurado."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:61
msgid ""
"Navigate to: ``Azure Active Directory > Enterprise Applications > Single "
"sign-on``"
msgstr "Navegue até: ``Azure Active Directory > Enterprise Applications > Single sign-on``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:63
msgid ""
"On Step 1 (``Basic SAML Configuration``), click the ``Edit`` button and "
"enter the following:"
msgstr "No Passo 1 (``Basic SAML Configuration``), clique no botão ``Edit`` e informe o seguinte:"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:65
msgid "Identifier (Entity ID)"
msgstr "Identifier (Entity ID)"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:66
msgid ""
"Enter the ``Entity ID`` URL from the |morpheus| Identity Source "
"Integration above"
msgstr "Informe a URL ``Entity ID`` da Integração de Identity Source do |morpheus| acima"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:68
msgid "Reply URL (Assertion Consumer Service URL)"
msgstr "Reply URL (Assertion Consumer Service URL)"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:69
msgid ""
"Enter the ``SP ACS URL`` from the |morpheus| Identity Source Integration "
"above"
msgstr "Informe a ``SP ACS URL`` da Integração de Identity Source do |morpheus| acima"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:71
msgid "Logout URL"
msgstr "Logout URL"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:72
msgid ""
"Enter the following format:  ``https://yourUrl/login/`` If this is a sub "
"tenant, the format may instead be the following:  "
"``https://yourUrl/login/account/1`` The login URL can be found under "
":guilabel:`IDENTITY SOURCES` in the tenant"
msgstr "Informe o seguinte formato:  ``https://yourUrl/login/`` Se for um sub tenant, o formato pode ser o seguinte:  ``https://yourUrl/login/account/1`` A URL de login pode ser encontrada em :guilabel:`IDENTITY SOURCES` no tenant"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:76
msgid "On Step 2 (``Attributes and Claims``), click the ``Edit`` button"
msgstr "No Passo 2 (``Attributes and Claims``), clique no botão ``Edit``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:77
msgid "Click the ``Add a group claim`` button at the top"
msgstr "Clique no botão ``Add a group claim`` na parte superior"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:78
msgid ""
"Choose ``All groups`` and ensure ``Group ID`` is selected for the "
"``Source attribute`` dropdown"
msgstr "Escolha ``All groups`` e certifique-se de que ``Group ID`` esteja selecionado no dropdown ``Source attribute``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:80
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:85
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:91
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:105
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:109
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:113
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:141
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:145
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:187
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:80
msgid ""
"You can also choose ``Security groups``, which ever makes more sense for "
"the organization"
msgstr "Você também pode escolher ``Security groups``, o que fizer mais sentido para a organização"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:82
msgid ""
"Close the pane and return to the Enterprise Application in the ``Single "
"sign-on`` section"
msgstr "Feche o painel e retorne à Enterprise Application na seção ``Single sign-on``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:83
msgid ""
"On Step 3 (``SAML Certificates``), click the ``Download`` link next to "
"``Certificate (Base64)`` and ``Federation Metadata XML``"
msgstr "No Passo 3 (``SAML Certificates``), clique no link ``Download`` ao lado de ``Certificate (Base64)`` e ``Federation Metadata XML``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:85
msgid ""
"The files will download, keep them available for later configuation in "
"|morpheus|"
msgstr "Os arquivos serão baixados; mantenha-os disponíveis para configuração posterior no |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:87
msgid "Navigate to ``Users and Groups`` in the left pane"
msgstr "Navegue até ``Users and Groups`` no painel esquerdo"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:88
msgid "Click the ``Add user/group`` button"
msgstr "Clique no botão ``Add user/group``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:89
msgid ""
"Add Azure groups to this application that will be able to login to "
"|morpheus|"
msgstr "Adicione grupos do Azure a esta aplicação que poderão fazer login no |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:91
msgid ""
"Note the object ID for each of these groups, as they will be used later "
"when configuring |morpheus| to map the group to roles"
msgstr "Anote o object ID de cada um desses grupos, pois serão usados mais tarde ao configurar o |morpheus| para mapear o grupo às funções"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:93
msgid "Once groups have been added, click the ``Assign`` button at the bottom"
msgstr "Depois que os grupos forem adicionados, clique no botão ``Assign`` na parte inferior"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:96
msgid "Configure the Azure AD SAML Integration in |morpheus|"
msgstr "Configurar a Integração Azure AD SAML no |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:98
msgid "Login to |morpheus| using ``Username and Password``, as usual"
msgstr "Faça login no |morpheus| usando ``Username and Password``, como de costume"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:101
msgid "Select :guilabel:`IDENTITY SOURCES` in the Tenant detail page"
msgstr "Selecione :guilabel:`IDENTITY SOURCES` na página de detalhe do Tenant"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:102
msgid "Click the pencil (edit) next to the integration created previously"
msgstr "Clique no lápis (editar) ao lado da integração criada anteriormente"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:103
msgid "Ensure the ``SAML REQUEST`` field is set to ``Self Signed``"
msgstr "Certifique-se de que o campo ``SAML REQUEST`` esteja definido como ``Self Signed``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:105
msgid ""
"A custom RSA signature can be used here if needed, if required by the "
"orgnaization"
msgstr "Uma assinatura RSA personalizada pode ser usada aqui se necessário, se exigido pela organização"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:107
msgid ""
"Ensure the ``SAML RESPONSE`` field is set to ``Validate Assertion "
"Signature``"
msgstr "Certifique-se de que o campo ``SAML RESPONSE`` esteja definido como ``Validate Assertion Signature``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:109
msgid ""
"With this setting, if the assertion signature ever changes in the Azure "
"Enterprise Application, this would need to be updated to match"
msgstr "Com esta configuração, se a assinatura da assertion mudar na Azure Enterprise Application, ela precisará ser atualizada para corresponder"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:111
msgid ""
"Edit/view the downloaded ``Federation Metadata XML`` (``.xml`` extension)"
" file from the previous section"
msgstr "Edite/visualize o arquivo ``Federation Metadata XML`` (extensão ``.xml``) baixado da seção anterior"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:113
msgid ""
"It is recommended to use ``Microsoft Edge``, or another browser, to view "
"the contents"
msgstr "Recomenda-se usar o ``Microsoft Edge``, ou outro navegador, para visualizar o conteúdo"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:115
msgid ""
"In the ``Federation Metadata XML`` file, locate the ``<X509Certificate> "
"</X509Certificate>`` under the ``<Signature>`` section.  Copy the entire "
"contents between the ``<X509Certificate>`` and ``</X509Certificate>``, it"
" is very long"
msgstr "No arquivo ``Federation Metadata XML``, localize o ``<X509Certificate> </X509Certificate>`` na seção ``<Signature>``. Copie todo o conteúdo entre ``<X509Certificate>`` e ``</X509Certificate>``; é muito longo"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:116
msgid ""
"Paste the value copied from the ``Federation Metadata XML`` file into the"
" ``Public Key (Optional)`` box, below the ``SAML RESPONSE`` dropdown"
msgstr "Cole o valor copiado do arquivo ``Federation Metadata XML`` na caixa ``Public Key (Optional)``, abaixo do dropdown ``SAML RESPONSE``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:119
msgid "Configure Role Mappings"
msgstr "Configurar Mapeamentos de Função"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:121
msgid ""
"Role mappings will map Azure AD Groups to Morpheus Roles. Azure AD users "
"will be assigned Roles in |morpheus| upon signing in based on their Group"
" Membership in Azure AD."
msgstr "Os mapeamentos de função mapearão Azure AD Groups para Funções do Morpheus. Usuários do Azure AD receberão Funções no |morpheus| ao fazer login com base em sua Group Membership no Azure AD."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:123
#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:134
msgid ""
"Use an Azure Groups ``Object ID``, not Group name, when entering Role "
"Mappings. Example: ``7626a4a2-b388-4d9b-a228-72ce9a33bd4b``"
msgstr "Use um ``Object ID`` de Azure Groups, não o nome do Group, ao informar os Mapeamentos de Função. Exemplo: ``7626a4a2-b388-4d9b-a228-72ce9a33bd4b``"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:125
msgid "DEFAULT ROLE"
msgstr "DEFAULT ROLE"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:126
msgid ""
"Role a Azure AD user will be assigned by default upon signing in to "
"|morpheus| using this Identity Source."
msgstr "Função que um usuário Azure AD receberá por padrão ao fazer login no |morpheus| usando esta Identity Source."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:127
msgid "REQUIRED AZURE AD GROUP OBJECT ID"
msgstr "REQUIRED AZURE AD GROUP OBJECT ID"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:128
msgid ""
"Object ID of Azure AD Group a user must be a member of to be authorized "
"to sign in to |morpheus|. Users not belonging to this Group will not be "
"authorized to login to |morpheus|. This field is optional, and if left "
"blank, any user from the Azure AD App will be able to sign in to "
"|morpheus| and will be assigned the Default Role if no Role Mappings "
"match AD Group membership."
msgstr "Object ID do Azure AD Group do qual um usuário deve ser membro para ser autorizado a fazer login no |morpheus|. Usuários que não pertencerem a este Group não serão autorizados a fazer login no |morpheus|. Este campo é opcional e, se deixado em branco, qualquer usuário do Azure AD App poderá fazer login no |morpheus| e receberá a Default Role se nenhum Mapeamento de Função corresponder à associação de AD Group."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:129
msgid "GROUP ASSERTION ATTRIBUTE NAME"
msgstr "GROUP ASSERTION ATTRIBUTE NAME"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:130
msgid ""
"Enter ``http://schemas.microsoft.com/ws/2008/06/identity/claims/groups`` "
"for Azure AD SSO"
msgstr "Informe ``http://schemas.microsoft.com/ws/2008/06/identity/claims/groups`` para Azure AD SSO"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:131
msgid "Additional Role Mappings"
msgstr "Mapeamentos de Função Adicionais"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:132
msgid ""
"The existing Roles in |morpheus| will be listed. To map a |morpheus| Role"
" to an Azure AD Group, enter the Object ID of the desired Azure AD Group "
"in the `Role Attribute Value` field for the corresponding |morpheus| "
"Role."
msgstr "As Funções existentes no |morpheus| serão listadas. Para mapear uma Função do |morpheus| a um Azure AD Group, informe o Object ID do Azure AD Group desejado no campo `Role Attribute Value` da Função correspondente do |morpheus|."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:136
msgid "ENABLE ROLE MAPPING PERMISSION"
msgstr "ENABLE ROLE MAPPING PERMISSION"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:137
msgid ""
"When selected, Tenant users with appropriate rights to view and edit "
"Roles will have the ability to set role mapping for the Identity Source "
"integration. This allows the Tenant user to edit only the role mappings "
"without viewing or potentially editing the Identity Source configuration."
msgstr "Quando selecionado, usuários do Tenant com direitos apropriados para visualizar e editar Funções terão a capacidade de definir o mapeamento de função para a integração de Identity Source. Isso permite que o usuário do Tenant edite apenas os mapeamentos de função sem visualizar ou potencialmente editar a configuração da Identity Source."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:138
msgid "MANUAL ROLE ASSIGNMENT"
msgstr "MANUAL ROLE ASSIGNMENT"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:139
msgid ""
"When selected, administrators can manually edit Roles for users created "
"through this identity source integration from the user detail page "
"(|AdmUse| > Selected user)."
msgstr "Quando selecionado, administradores podem editar manualmente as Funções de usuários criados por meio desta integração de identity source na página de detalhe do usuário (|AdmUse| > Selected user)."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:141
msgid ""
"For more on Identity Source role mapping permissions, see the `associated"
" guide <https://support.morpheusdata.com/s/article/How-to-enable-"
"Subtenant-admins-to-edit-Identity-Source-role-mapping?language=en_US>`_ "
"in our KnowledgeBase."
msgstr "Para mais informações sobre permissões de mapeamento de função da Identity Source, consulte o `guia associado <https://support.morpheusdata.com/s/article/How-to-enable-Subtenant-admins-to-edit-Identity-Source-role-mapping?language=en_US>`_ em nossa KnowledgeBase."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:143
msgid ""
"Once populated, select :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES` and the SAML identity "
"source integration will be added. The Identity Source can be edited "
"anytime to deactivate or change Role Mappings or other values."
msgstr "Após o preenchimento, selecione :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES` e a integração de identity source SAML será adicionada. A Identity Source pode ser editada a qualquer momento para desativar ou alterar Mapeamentos de Função ou outros valores."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:145
msgid ""
"If Role mappings are edited after Azure AD SSO users have signed into "
"|morpheus|, currently logged in users will need to log out of |morpheus| "
"for the new Role mappings to take effect, when applicable."
msgstr "Se os mapeamentos de Função forem editados após usuários Azure AD SSO terem feito login no |morpheus|, os usuários atualmente logados precisarão sair do |morpheus| para que os novos mapeamentos de Função tenham efeito, quando aplicável."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:147
msgid ""
"Under the ``Role Azure Group Mappings`` secton, verify the ``DEFAULT "
"ROLE`` dropdown has the role in |morpheus| selected that all users will "
"be assigned by default"
msgstr "Na seção ``Role Azure Group Mappings``, verifique se o dropdown ``DEFAULT ROLE`` tem a função no |morpheus| selecionada que todos os usuários receberão por padrão"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:149
msgid ""
"It is recommended that this role contains no permissions, which ensures "
"that anyone who authenticates gets no access"
msgstr "Recomenda-se que esta função não contenha permissões, o que garante que qualquer pessoa que autentique não obtenha acesso"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/AzureAD.rst:151
msgid ""
"Under the ``Role Azure Group Mappings`` secton, you will see role names "
"listed.  Next to these are text boxes with ``Assertion Attribute "
"Mappings`` inside.  Enter group object IDs from Azure into these text "
"boxes.  This will map the Azure AD groups to specific roles in Morpheus"
